  "definition": "The ratio of the plant's actual generated energy to its maximum possible energy output over the same period, expressed as a percentage: $CF = \\frac{E_{out}}{P_{rated} \\times T_{period}} \\times 100\\%$, where $T_{period}$ is the number of hours in the period."
